{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"Creality.CrealityScan.4","latestVersion":"4.3.3","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.2356f997.png","priority":1,"sha256":"2356f9970ed8e146d48ab778dbc55392c67a3199dd5b641cea8bcf06323b3f34","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Creality Scan 是专为创想三维旗下扫描仪设计的 3D 扫描软件，拥有丰富的功能，能帮助用户实现高质量的扫描和完整的模型构建。该软件支持一键模型优化、多位置自动对齐、自动去噪、拓扑简化、颜色纹理映射等实用功能，还能导出 STL、OBJ 和 PLY 格式的 3D 模型及点云数据，让用户操作更加简便和高效。","license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Creality Scan is a dedicated 3D scanning software designed for Creality's scanners, offering a wide range of features to help users achieve high-quality scans and complete model construction.","license":"Proprietary","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Creality Scan is a dedicated 3D scanning software designed for Creality's scanners, offering a wide range of features to help users achieve high-quality scans and complete model construction. The software supports practical functions such as one-click model optimization, multi-position automatic alignment, automatic denoising, topology simplification, and color texture mapping. It also allows users to export 3D models and point cloud data in STL, OBJ, and PLY formats, making operations simpler and more efficient.","packageUrl":"https://www.creality.com/pages/download-software","publisherUrl":"https://www.creality.com/","tags":["3d","3d-printer","3d-printing","model","slicer"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"Creality Scan 是专为创想三维旗下扫描仪设计的 3D 扫描软件，拥有丰富的功能，能帮助用户实现高质量的扫描和完整的模型构建。该软件支持一键模型优化、多位置自动对齐、自动去噪、拓扑简化、颜色纹理映射等实用功能，还能导出 STL、OBJ 和 PLY 格式的 3D 模型及点云数据，让用户操作更加简便和高效。","license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","name":"CrealityScan 4","packageUrl":"https://www.crealitycloud.cn/downloads","publisher":"Creality","tags":["3d","3d打印","3d打印机","切片","模型"]}},"name":"CrealityScan 4","packageUrl":"https://www.crealitycloud.cn/downloads","publisher":"Creality","tags":["3d","3d打印","3d打印机","切片","模型"]},"schemaVersi